WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Hey, I’m Matthew from Northland Precast.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.360
Come with me to tour our new precast
facility in Shelburne, Ontario.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.360
[Music]

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.550
This is our laydown, where we have
all our steel structure and cranes

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.960
ready to be installed
to make this facility happen.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.250
I haven’t told you
what we’re building here yet.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.200
We’re going to be supplying
a product called Superior Walls.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.000
These panels come pre-insulated
with studs, and you can do

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.150
the foundation of your home in one day.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:24.900
We’re currently forming our foundation
and grade beams, pouring next week,

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.520
and hopefully we get the steel structure
up and running for next year.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.500
[Music]
